\ Exercises virtual-type generator words under runtime-image AOT.
\ The wrap (>weight, make-weight), unwrap (unmake-weight), and predicate
\ (weight?) words are compound bodies generated at definition time. They
\ push the virtual type's TypeValue as a .type_val literal, which must
\ be routed through the runtime-image slot table for AOT.

weight: virtual{ fixnum } ;

42 make-weight weight? .
42 make-weight unmake-weight .
42 >weight unmake-weight .
"hello" weight? .
